"We are removing your profile, discoveries, conversations and shared links." = "正在移除你的個人資料、探索記錄、聊天記錄和分享連結。";
"Retry deletion" = "重試刪除";
"Deletion could not finish. Your request is saved. Please try again when online." = "刪除尚未完成。請求已儲存，請連線後重試。";

"Cloud AI permission" = "雲端 AI 授權";
"Cloud AI is allowed" = "已允許使用雲端 AI";
"Cloud AI is off" = "雲端 AI 已關閉";
"With your permission, questions, selected photos, age, interests and relevant earlier discoveries are sent through our Cloudflare backend to cloud AI services. Answer text is also used to create narration and card illustrations." = "經您同意，問題、選取的照片、年齡、興趣和相關的歷史探索內容，會透過我們的 Cloudflare 後端傳送給雲端 AI 服務。回答文字也會用於產生語音和卡片插畫。";
"Review the service providers and data handling in our privacy policy before allowing cloud AI. Do not include names, addresses, school details or photos of people." = "允許使用前，請閱讀隱私權政策中的服務提供者及資料處理說明。請勿輸入姓名、住址、學校資訊或上傳人物照片。";
"You can keep using saved cards and prepared discoveries without allowing cloud AI. Turning it off stops new requests. Requests already sent cannot be recalled. Use Delete account and data to remove saved server records." = "不授權也能使用已儲存的卡片和預製探索內容。關閉後會停止新請求，已傳送的請求無法撤回。如需刪除伺服器上的紀錄，請使用「刪除帳號和資料」。";
"Create family settings above before a grown-up can allow cloud AI." = "請先在上方建立家庭設定，再由家長允許使用雲端 AI。";
"Allow cloud AI data use" = "允許雲端 AI 使用上述資料";
"Turn off cloud AI" = "關閉雲端 AI";
"Cloud AI is off on this device. We will finish the withdrawal on the server when you are online." = "此裝置上的雲端 AI 已關閉。連線後，我們會繼續完成伺服器端的撤回操作。";
"Could not update the AI permission. Please try again when online." = "無法更新 AI 授權，請連線後重試。";
"Ask a grown-up to review cloud AI data use. Your question stays on this device until permission is given." = "請家長查看雲端 AI 的資料使用說明。獲得授權前，問題會保留在此裝置上。";
"The AI permission has changed. Please review it again." = "AI 授權狀態已變更，請重新查看。";
